				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Supported bounded slice\nOwner: CatalystFoundation. Configuration authoring uses Atelier as the single supported flexible editor, not a competing composer. {{gtMethod:CFConfiguration>>#asAtelier}} is the intentional entry. {{gtMethod:CFConfiguration>>#descriptionContainerDetail:}} selects Foundation Detail through the existing Magritte container presentation stencil. Both are GT-only extensions in BVC-Foundation-Config-UI-Core; the portable configuration core gains no UI class dependency. Generic {{gtMethod:CFMaPresentationStencilBuilder>>#buildDefault}} remains unchanged.\n\nReuse: CFAtelierViewModel, CFMaDetailPresentation, CFAtelierInspectorElement and CFMaMemento. No new classes, dispatcher or adapter. The root CFMaMemento owns the authoring transaction; child forms edit through its existing child mementos. When opening a focused inspector, supply that child memento and set the presentation's transactionMemento to the root through inspectObject:memento:presentationDo:. This increment proves that existing explicit seam; it does not add automatic nested navigation or infer a transaction from configuration parent links. Domain parent ownership is unchanged during scalar staging/reset. Relation insertion/removal continues to use existing configuration context hooks; it is not migrated in this increment."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
