					"uidString" : "1R/Jc8kuRx+/iBJU9LWijg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Timeout recovery and image boundary\nBefore this increment: inspected CFConfiguration, Atelier/Magritte entry/build protocols, implementors/senders, examples and registered DevKit working rules/framework ownership. CFConfiguration still had only its parent/root/ancestry/initialization/relation/validation methods and class defaultWithParent:. Its asAtelier override was absent; implementors were Object, CPDefinitions and CPProcess. No configuration-Atelier adapter class appeared in the class-name search. Existing Atelier implementation was retained.\n\nIceberg reported no modified CatalystFoundation packages and an empty working-copy diff against reference 59dd780150d6e655bbd885ccbdbc81ccf1683990. Thus no pending Foundation source change from timed-out execution 7xrikwp1ivqgm9uhv6fggg39c was established; this is not proof it performed no work or that prior saved/reverted work did not occur. No execution history attribution is available. Unrelated pre-existing dirty packages were Sparta-Core, Sparta-Skia, Grease-Tests-Pharo-Core, Grease-Pharo110-Slime-Core, Grease-Tests-Pharo-Slime, Grease-Pharo110-Slime-Portability and Grease-Tests-Core; preserved untouched. Other registered Catalyst repositories reported no modified packages.\n\nPending image selectors: CFConfiguration>>asAtelier and >>descriptionContainerDetail: (extensions owned by BVC-Foundation-Config-UI-Core); CFConfigurationExamples>>configurationOpensAsAtelierWithDetail and >>nestedConfigurationAtelierStagesAndResetsSharedTransaction (BVC-Foundation-Config-Examples). No existing selector replaced. No source export/save, staging, commit, push, build or Runtime activation."
			},
			{
