				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Current-image checks and limits\nPlatform: Pharo13.1.0SNAPSHOT, SuperGame.image. examplesInClassesRun: CFConfigurationExamples, CFAtelierEntryExamples, CFMaDetailPresentationExamples and CFMaPresentationExamples: 98 successes, zero failures/errors/skips. CFMaEmbeddedTransactionExamples and CFMaPhlowNavigationExamples: 12 successes, zero failures/errors/skips. Targeted Process check CPProcessAtelierExamples>>documentRootedSessionCreatesProcessFocusedViewModel: success. Final CFConfigurationExamples rerun after strengthening the entry example to capture Atelier's actual presentation hooks synchronously: 14 successes, zero failures/errors/skips. In total 111 distinct example methods, 125 successful executions across these runs. An earlier version of the new entry example failed because preparedElementForMemento: bypasses Atelier's newFormElement callback composition; the example was corrected to run the actual Atelier entry and synchronously initialize its form. That diagnostic failure is retained in tool evidence, not counted as a passing run.\n\nAcceptance: entry selects Atelier plus Detail; nested scalar edit stays staged, inspector retains child memento identity and explicit root action transaction, root reset restores staged value while preserving domain parent and collection identity; focused regressions pass; this maintained documentation home records the boundary. New examples are executable below. No SUnit suite, whole Process suite, legacy editor/animation suite, interactive visual usability, fresh BVC build or GemStone/native validation was performed. Automated form construction is not interactive usability proof."
			},
