				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Legacy status and next increment\nCFConfigurationEditorElement is a retained legacy independent editor, not the target authoring path. Current class-reference inspection found only CFConfigurationEditorElementExamples>>overlayPreviewIsNotAPlacementAnimationOrigin, >>placementAnimationCombinesAffectedRelationsWithoutDuplicates and >>placementAnimationDoesNotTraverseUnaffectedNestedRelations. Its library discovery/planner/sidebar and animation behavior remain untouched. No literal composer reference was found in the bounded source set CFConfiguration, CFConfigurationExamples, CFAtelierViewModel and CFConfigurationEditorElement; this is not a global legacy cleanup claim. Historical composer terminology denotes Atelier's predecessor, not a second supported destination.\n\nNext increment: design and implement the existing configuration library handoff into Atelier using current palette/relation protocols and the same staged transaction, with focused ownership and reset checks. Palette capture/storage, hierarchy/codec migration and Runtime integration are excluded here. Legacy editor removal requires migrated library/placement/animation consumers, equivalent accepted Atelier coverage and a fresh caller/reference review; do not delete it merely because this entry slice is green. This page is the maintained home for this bounded authoring contract, under the DevKit framework ownership index; no Foundation-specific registered book was available during this increment."
			},
