				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Configuration consolidation contract\nSee {{gtPage:Configuration model and composition contract|db=731asfxqhyhdr96k6wo9yxnzv}} for the bounded model contract and blocked retry evidence. Planner discovery/simulation/new-validation-error rejection remain mandatory. Smooth, intent-revealing Motion animation is CORE Atelier behavior, not optional polish. Generic Magritte composition remains the direction; configuration specialises it. Immediate configuration placement parent hooks versus generic CFMaMemento staged relation integration remains the next slice, not completed support. Historical checks above are not post-consolidation verification."
			}
